<head>
<meta charset='utf-8'>
<title>Sanctions Undertaking Letter - LBH Bullion Gold Trading L.L.C</title>
<style>
body { font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1A1815; margin: 40px; }
.header-box { border-bottom: 2px solid #C5A059; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.company-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; color: #1A1815; text-transform: uppercase; }
.doc-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; text-decoration: underline; color: #1A1815; }
.note { font-style: italic; color: #666057; font-size: 9.5pt; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.sign-box { margin-top: 40px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class='header-box'>
  <div class='note'>[PLEASE PRINT ON CLIENT COMPANY OFFICIAL LETTERHEAD]</div>
  <div class='company-title'>CLIENT COMPANY NAME: ____________________________________</div>
  <div>Registered Address: ___________________________________________________________</div>
</div>

<div style='margin-bottom: 15px;'>
  <strong>Date:</strong> _____ / _____ / 202___<br>
  <strong>To:</strong> LBH BULLION GOLD TRADING L.L.C<br>
  Office No. 403, Al Dhagaya, Al Ras, Deira, Dubai, UAE<br>
  Tel: +971 4 262 6916 | Email: lbhbullion@gmail.com
</div>

<div class='doc-title'>UNDERTAKING LETTER - SANCTIONS & TRADE EMBARGOES</div>

<p>Dear Sir / Madam,</p>

<p>
I, the undersigned, __________________________________________________, of __________________________ Nationality, holding Passport No. ______________________________ and Emirates ID No. ______________________________, in my capacity as Owner & Ultimate Beneficial Owner (UBO) / Authorized Signatory of <strong>[Company Name]</strong>, hereby formally confirm, represent, and warrant to <strong>LBH BULLION GOLD TRADING L.L.C</strong> that:
</p>

<ol style='margin-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;'>
  <li>
    Neither our corporate entity nor any of our directors, officers, beneficial owners, shareholders, or related affiliates are dealing with, located in, or transacting on behalf of sanctioned countries or designated entities listed by the <strong>United Arab Emirates</strong>, the <strong>United Nations Security Council</strong>, the <strong>United States (OFAC)</strong>, the <strong>European Union</strong>, or the <strong>United Kingdom (OFSI)</strong>.
  </li>
  <li>
    Our entity is not owned, controlled by, or operating as an agent of the Governments of Iran, North Korea, Myanmar, or any other sanctioned regime, nor resident or domiciled in Iran, North Korea, or Myanmar.
  </li>
  <li>
    All our commercial and precious metals trading operations have never dealt with, do not currently deal with, and will never involve any sanctioned jurisdiction or entity, nor will they violate or cause to violate any economic or financial sanctions, trade embargoes, or export/import restrictions administered by the UAE Ministry of Economy or international sanctions authorities.
  </li>
  <li>
    Neither I nor any key executive or trading personnel are acting as nominees, proxies, or front-persons for any individual or entity originating from or residing in any sanctioned jurisdiction.
  </li>
  <li>
    The funds and financial assets used to purchase or settle physical gold, silver, diamonds, or precious metals do not consist of, originate from, or relate to proceeds derived from criminal conduct, money laundering, fraud, terrorist financing, or any illegal enterprise.
  </li>
</ol>

<div class='sign-box'>
  <p>Sincerely,</p>
  <p>For & on Behalf of <strong>[Company Name]</strong>:</p>
  <br><br>
  <p>___________________________________________<br>
  <strong>Authorized Signatory Name:</strong><br>
  <strong>Designation / Title:</strong><br>
  <strong>Company Name:</strong><br>
  <strong>[Company Stamp / Seal]</strong></p>
</div>

</body>
</html>